<section style="padding:96px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Harbour Tank Co handles oil tank replacement in St. John's and the surrounding Avalon communities. We pull the old tank, set the new one, connect it to your furnace, and have a licensed inspector tag and register it so your fuel company can deliver again. The price is $3,200 for a 200-gallon steel tank or $3,850 for fibreglass, and both include removal of the old tank.</p><p>Most calls we get start the same way: the delivery truck showed up, the driver checked the HOST tag, saw an expired date, and left without filling. That's a bad afternoon in January. Call (709) 800-3117 and we'll get you a written estimate and a swap date, or read on to see how the process works and <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-cost/">what drives the cost</a>.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Handle</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">What's Included in Every Visit</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Same-week swap</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Once you approve the estimate we book you in for the same week. If you're out of oil or your tag has already expired, tell us and we'll move you up.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Old tank removal included</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Disconnecting, draining and hauling away the old tank is part of the $3,200 price. No surprise line item for disposal.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Steel or fibreglass, your call</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A 200-gallon steel tank is $3,200 installed. A fibreglass tank is $3,850 and doesn't carry a set expiry date under NLR 60/03, which matters if you plan to stay in the house a while.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">New HOST tag and registration</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A licensed inspector tags and registers the new system with Digital Government and Service NL and issues the confirmation of registration your insurer and lawyer will ask for.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Free written estimate</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We look at the tank, the lines and the site, then put the number in writing before any work starts. No obligation and no pressure.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
