        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Refused delivery, a wet spot under the tank, or the smell of oil in the basement? Call (709) 800-3117 any hour and you'll reach a person, not a machine.</p>
      </div>
</div>
